# Private and client-facing routes never belong in Google's index (SEO audit
# 2026-09-10, E1). noindex via header rather than robots.txt Disallow, so that
# URLs already indexed get re-crawled, see the header, and drop out. The
# marketing pages stay indexable: /, /cle, /cle/*, /wellness-funds,
# /holiday-page/*, /holiday-generic, /solutions/*.
